              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "आप रोज घरै जावो हो? — āp roj gharai jāvo ho? — Do you go home every day?",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: **आप रोज घरै जावो हो?** — *āp roj gharai jāvo ho?* — Do you go home every day?]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
